title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (sequence graph with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,C\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(X,C\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (guessed set and club witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (regular-cardinal, club, and function predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9DiamondPlusSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9DiamondPlusSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9DiamondPlusSequence}_S(A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,A(\\alpha),(\\alpha+1)\\times\\omega)\\land\\forall B,C\\in A(\\alpha)\\;(e(B)=e(C)\\to B=C)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in A(\\alpha)\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in A(\\alpha))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9DiamondPlusSequence}_S(A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,A(\\alpha),(\\alpha+1)\\times\\omega)\\land\\forall B,C\\in A(\\alpha)\\;(e(B)=e(C)\\to B=C)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in A(\\alpha)\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in A(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The candidate-family bound is witnessed by an explicit injection into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha+1)\\times\\omega\">\\((\\alpha+1)\\times\\omega\\)</span>, whose cardinality is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|+\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\alpha|+\\aleph_0\\)</span>; no unsourced cardinality bars remain.</li>\n<li>At <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_1\\)</span> this is the standard countable-candidate formulation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^+\">\\(\\Diamond^+\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-diamond","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-diamond]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数